### Scenario
Your school installs a vending machine to provide snacks and drinks. However, students face issues related to access.
* Sometimes the machine does not yield the correct change.
* Decisions take tool long top select items or check availability.
* Students queue long before getting inside the building/canteen.
* System fails to function when multiple students wait in line / attempt access.


