### Step 4: Draw a Flowchart or Write Pseudocode for the Identified Sub-Problem
*(Pseudocode for Sub-Problem 1: Change Calculation)*

```text
START
  Input ItemCode
  Input CashInserted
  
  Set ItemPrice = GetPrice(ItemCode)
  Set StockCount = GetStock(ItemCode)
  
  IF StockCount <= 0 THEN
      DISPLAY "Item Out of Stock"
      RETURN CashInserted
  ELSE IF CashInserted < ItemPrice THEN
      DISPLAY "Insufficient Funds"
      RETURN CashInserted
  ELSE
      Set ChangeAmount = CashInserted - ItemPrice
      IF CheckMachineVault(ChangeAmount) == TRUE THEN
          DispenseItem(ItemCode)
          DispenseChange(ChangeAmount)
          DISPLAY "Transaction Complete. Thank you!"
      ELSE
          DISPLAY "Exact Change Unavailable. Transaction Cancelled."
          RETURN CashInserted
      ENDIF
  ENDIF
END
